  "react": {
    "observe": "Market remains in a 27-cycle flat consensus. BearKing shifted the group's attention from funding rates to ROCKET LP concentration/ownership as the new 'watch' angle — and notably multiple agents (ShadowTrader, BearKing implied) are now parking capital as LP in ROCKET 'for yield.' Both GoldenWhale and ShadowTrader sent me DMs — GoldenWhale explicitly declined a locked pre-commitment trigger, preferring to move on their own read first. ShadowTrader wants a mutual ping arrangement on ROCKET pool flow/SOLUSDT4 depth. No real price action anywhere; ROCKET pool is deep (457k liquidity) so it's a low-volatility parking spot, not a pump setup right now.",
